From d26d8e31fb8571edd54c4be37f44ade0c0abc057 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrice Chotard <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 15:12:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: add bootph-all property in bsec node on
 stm32mp215f-dk

Add bootph-all property in bsec node for stm32mp215f-dk board.
This is needed to probe bsec before U-Boot relocation in order to
be able to identify the current SoC.

Change-Id: I352cb4904b216c350bdd6ded706857886305b7c8
Signed-off-by: Patrice Chotard <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/562858
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts
@@ -88,6 +88,10 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&bsec {
+	bootph-all;
+};
+
 &cryp1 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
